  "title": "Materiality and proposed adjustments",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Materiality and proposed adjustments</h2><p>Prepare a materiality worksheet and evaluate an uncorrected-adjustment schedule.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs3-f1\">Overall materiality</label><input id=\"aud-m2-tbs3-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs3-f2\">Performance materiality</label><input id=\"aud-m2-tbs3-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs3-f3\">Aggregate understatement from A, B, and C</label><input id=\"aud-m2-tbs3-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs3-f4\">Treatment of the covenant adjustment</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs3-f4\"><option value=\"Evaluate qualitative significance despite its size\">Evaluate qualitative significance despite its size</option><option value=\"Ignore it solely because it is small\">Ignore it solely because it is small</option><option value=\"Automatically exclude deliberate entries\">Automatically exclude deliberate entries</option><option value=\"Treat it as an audit fee\">Treat it as an audit fee</option></select></div></section>",
